WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:01.653
- Hi!

00:00:01.653 --> 00:00:02.551
- Hey!

00:00:02.551 --> 00:00:03.880
[Cross Talk]

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:04.780
- Do we look okay?

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:11.130
[Cross Talk]

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.790
- Oh is that a devil Melissa?

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:14.800
[Cross Talk]

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.793
- We are the Neutz family.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.460
- We've always been
known as a large family

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.123
and we're all so very close.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.203
We're a strong family of faith.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.290
- When we get together
it's 60 or 70 people

00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:36.150
- I guess when I think about
my family, I just think

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:39.000
I'm one of the luckiest guys
in the world, I really do.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.603
We're all very close.

00:00:42.171 --> 00:00:44.171
[Singing Happy Birthday]

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.170
- We went from worrying
about our hands being clean

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:51.820
and what groceries we
needed to buy to not even

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.603
like a week and a half later
our mom's in the hospital.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:00.340
We realized we were not gonna
to be able to be with our mom

00:01:06.037 --> 00:01:08.037
[Melancholy piano music]

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:13.430
- I don't see how she was
able to raise eight children

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:16.510
with what we had and for
everybody to turn out pretty good

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.210
- She was devoted to the family,

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:22.150
you know we had an alcoholic father,

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:25.700
who unfortunately died an alcoholic.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.230
But mom was very strong

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.353
and she kept us together as a family.

00:01:33.416 --> 00:01:34.249
[Laughter]

00:01:36.818 --> 00:01:38.786
- What do you think Keiko?

00:01:38.786 --> 00:01:40.869
- [Laughs] She's so cute!

00:01:45.028 --> 00:01:47.028
[Melancholy piano music]

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.740
- When she first went into the hospital

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:58.640
and we knew that we weren't
going to be able to visit her,

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.230
it just really gave everyone
a sense of hopelessness

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:06.430
and helplessness that we
wouldn't have anything

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.510
that we could do, even if we wanted to,

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:11.250
to hold her hand or to be with her.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.363
Lacy figured out that we
could get a laptop to her.

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:18.188
- A nurse at the hospital
came and met me outside

00:02:18.188 --> 00:02:21.260
and grabbed the laptop
and within about an hour

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.600
it was up in her room set up.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.280
- Mom I think would have loved
that to be her last 24 hours,

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.820
- a party
- it was like a real party

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:32.650
- Say Happy New Year!

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:34.550
- Happy New Year!

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.770
- We even sent food and one
of the families got to watch

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:40.940
her enjoy her Japanese dinner and

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:44.750
you know, we even kind of thought

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.700
maybe she was gonna come around,

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:48.100
you know watching her there.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:54.500
- On Sunday, the doctors had let us know

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.453
that she was most likely
going to be passing soon.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.410
They were going to go ahead
and minister what they call

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.860
comfort drugs,

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.280
so each of the brothers
and sisters had gathered up

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:09.210
each of their family members
and then we each were able to

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.990
get on the House Party app
and spend time with her

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.393
as a family unit.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:18.630
- I would say mom it's Tommy,
and she would go, Tommy!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:21.460
I said I love you mom and she
responded back, I love you

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:24.193
and I cannot tell you
what that meant to me.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.780
They had her on an oxygen
mask, they had a mask

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.220
that just covered her face

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.613
and oxygen was blowing through that mask.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:36.870
When they did pull the mask off,

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:39.940
the nurse was holding her
hand, within less than a minute

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:40.993
she said she's gone.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.600
When they went to go remove that mask,

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.730
was when the nurses
gathered around her room

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:51.330
outside her door and the
other nurses held her hand.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:55.443
So it was a pretty touching
moment for all of us.

00:03:57.075 --> 00:03:59.800
- The hardest part of this for me is not

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.590
to be able to be with you all

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.090
because we're such a great
support for each other.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:08.360
- It feels a little surreal,

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.840
I know that she was in the hospital

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.593
and I know that she's not here,

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.960
but it also seems like kind
of was it just a dream?

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.590
Like did it really happen?

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:21.940
Some of it just seems not real
because you didn't see her

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.683
and we didn't all get together.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.460
- The whole situation
really just makes you feel

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.110
like you're being robbed,

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:32.190
of not being able to hug
your loved ones, you know,

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:34.323
or be with them, or talk about,

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.763
share stories about our
grandmother together.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:43.180
You just never imagine in a
million years that this is how

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.943
it would play out and this
is how it would happen.

